\hypertarget{regression}{%
\subsection{Regression}\label{regression}}

\hypertarget{ordinary-least-squares-regression}{%
\subsubsection{Ordinary least squares
regression}\label{ordinary-least-squares-regression}}


The OLS model achieves an out-of-sample $R^2$ of -0.0012 on the test set (January 2022 -- October 2024), with RMSE of 0.1852, MAE of 0.1078, and Spearman rank correlation of -0.0441 ($p$-value 0.0000).

