\hypertarget{penalized-regression}{%
\subsubsection{Penalized regression}\label{penalized-regression}}


The optimal regularization parameter selected via \texttt{LassoCV} with
5-fold time-series cross-validation is $\alpha = 4.50e-03$.
At this penalty level, 13 of 15 predictors are shrunk
exactly to zero, demonstrating the variable-selection property of LASSO.

The LASSO model achieves an out-of-sample $R^2$ of -0.0012 on the test set (January 2022 -- October 2024), with RMSE of 0.1852, MAE of 0.1075, and Spearman rank correlation of -0.0576 ($p$-value 0.0000).

